ler": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Animal World - Adventure Platformer", "keywords": ["grab", "climb", "sky", "company", "guys"], "long_description": "# Jump into a thrilling VR adventure filled with exploration, jumps, and battles.\n\n**Collect Ammo and Start the Adventure!**\n\nCollect ammo on the go and keep your weapons ready. With enemies ahead, every pickup helps you survive longer and fight harder in intense VR adventures.\n\n{1203783887842645}\n\n**Survive the Enemy Attack!**\n\nStep into thrilling fights filled with action and challenge. Each encounter demands smart moves and strong attacks.\n\n{1554484219131916}\n\n**Boost Your Health in Seconds!**\n\nGrab health pickups to recover instantly and stay in control. Keep moving forward without losing momentum.\n\n{865880012739241}", "short_description": "Step into Animal World - Adventure Platformer, a fun VR journey packed with jumping, exploring, and action combat. Collect ammo and health, smash obstacles with powerful hits, and take on enemies across colorful worlds. Discover secrets, interact with objects, and keep moving forward in this lively platformer adventure!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "2560 x 1440 (1).png", "id": "3916489165148717", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820441_3916489168482050_3962473572948157318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KkbfSDIAopgQ7kNvwHBHKXR&_nc_oc=Adqs_mBdPHjY2WrhSJjpzvrECLvkIUzCduaaShk92TsppmJwjyqyK5iMKM2v2n4GOjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS8h_EdNATuVW593d-jNcYZcS5zzTOiV86JcOTkeE8rlw&oe=6B0312C2"}, {"file_name": "3000 X 900.png", "id": "1818917172117398", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824318_1818917175450731_1640788482048149913_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QTm5C0UmuHoQ7kNvwGiLdZ